      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, I missed it. Thanks. Then CopyDepsToZip might need to be parameterized with dependencyTag as well. What I want to fix with these changes is that CopyDepsToZip relies on \"InstallDepNeeded\" of direct deps of PackagingBase to decide which to include. I thought that \"deps\" of \"filesystem\" modules are not meant to be installed together with filesystem module. I missed that \"cvd_host_package\" is different and requires install \"deps\" as well.",
      "parentUuid": "697725c6_b21a9a00",
