      "writtenOn": "2021-03-10T05:37:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No. I don\u0027t understand why we need to parameterize CopyDepsToZip. The CL I mentioned above was to support this legacy use case:\n\n`m cvd-host_package; acloud create --local-instance ...`\n\n`m cvd-host_package` shouldn\u0027t just install the zip archive only. It should also install its transitive dependencies into the out directory (as well as inside the archive).\n\nPackage-in-package in your example is actually a problem and this CL fixes that. But I don\u0027t think we will ever have such a configuration. So, a better approach would be not supporting it at all, or specialcasing it. e.g. if a dep implements PackageModule, we either stop traversing further, or query it to see if we can go further or not.",
      "parentUuid": "85a93d41_96520717",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 173,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 173,
        "endChar": 72
      },
